{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_st01","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_st01","title":"欣欣向荣","storyCode":"NL-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"f136b3f866fb92a04502bc91f0a197b3d2dbbd7cde6051a8ceb3f57fa9660096","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 纯1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“城市是一只怪物，它把人吞噬殆尽，我们却还要感恩戴德地待在它的肠胃里。”\n“等着生活把我们消化，等着白骨和血肉被排出，留下的会成为养分，供城市前行。”\n“即是文明欣欣向荣。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到卡西米尔国立竞技场！欢迎来到，卡西米尔特别锦标赛！我是各位的老朋友——大嘴莫布！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"经过了漫长的预选阶段，全卡西米尔翘首以盼的卡西米尔骑士特别锦标赛正赛阶段，将于今日迎来首场对决！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"决斗、竞速、花样竞技，三大类别、八大项目、四十三小项，荣誉、财富，无数骑士团和骑士们对奖牌势在必得！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众席上的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"......莫布怎么成了特锦赛解说？他是不是背地里给哪个发言人塞钱了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"捧着爆米花的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"塞钱？真要靠塞钱，这得塞多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众席上的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"莫布平时就喜欢口无遮拦，到这种大场合上，万一他一时嘴瓢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"捧着爆米花的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你知道吗，之前那个名嘴大胡子凯奇，就是因为在特锦赛上“调侃”了某位大骑士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"捧着爆米花的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"然后第二天就消失啦，要爆米花不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众席上的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，引咎辞职嘛，常见的伎俩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"捧着爆米花的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼声）我说的是消失（咀嚼声）不是辞职。你懂吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众席上的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"八支大骑士团，六十四支骑士团，以及两位特立独行的独立骑士，于今日齐聚特锦赛现场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔骑士特别锦标赛，将向整片泰拉大地，彰显骑士之美，彰显骑士之风！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本日的第一场比赛，将是来自锋盔骑士团与云雾骑士团的对决！来自双方的十位骑士，究竟能为骑士团斩获几个比分！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"巨额的奖金池哪怕此时此刻也在增加，来自卡西米尔各竞技场的每一点消费，都将按照骑士份额转化为特锦赛奖金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟哪个骑士团能获得最多的奖杯？又会是哪位骑士从决斗赛中脱颖而出，成为本届特锦赛的冠军骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们——拭目以待——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:43 P.M.  天气/晴\n大骑士领卡瓦莱利亚基，冠军墙展厅"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合身吗？马克维茨先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......托您的福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，一身定制的合乎礼仪的服装，是我们必备的门面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有留下那位裁缝的联络方式吗？我相信您还会用得到他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，麻烦给我一杯葡萄酒，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我只是在感叹，这场宴会多么盛大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......“也许”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你只是还没缓过神来，恰尔内先生的事情我们都很遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是个兢兢业业的人，无论是作为公司员工，还是作为联合会发言人，他都尽力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我在成为发言人之后才认识他，对于特锦赛的工作而言，我是新手，他才是前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他对待赏识的人一向不差，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别也许了，摆出个笑脸来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天才是开幕式的第二天，冠军墙对外开放的大好日子，驻场管理摆着一副臭脸可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您说得对，很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别总这么低声下气，马克维茨，咱们之间也别用“您”了，太过死板，不利于沟通。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？是不是有什么动静？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是特邀骑士嘉宾，我看看时间......你看，她一向很守时，真希望各位骑士都向她学习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我失陪一下，还有，请适应您可以免费取用酒水的权利，好好喝一杯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甜美的微醺，你该享受它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德罗斯特女士，又见面了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德罗斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，我来迟了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，再次感谢您的参与。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信烛骑士的光芒，将会为今夜的开幕宴会添上一笔绝美的色彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:15 P.M.  天气/阴\n大骑士领卡瓦莱利亚基，商业联合会大厦，会客室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用解释，小白金，我们也没打算怎么样......就是，工作嘛，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总得做做样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的失职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，失职，失职......我们可不是普通的上班族，干这行，“失职”这个词可是很要命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次还好，只是让耀骑士闯进了感染者聚集区......啊，不过你好像把莫妮克的事儿搞砸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的任务是用无人机把那些非法聚集点“砰”“啪”掉，然后把红松骑士团带去零号地块来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来挺轻松的，结果呢，杀出来个耀骑士，全泡汤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很不开心喔，你懂吧？本来她脾气就那样，要是有人碍着她拿奖金的话，那就更麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道莫妮克的目标是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你知道。再说你知不知道都不是借口啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为“追查感染者”本来是你的任务，我可是早就说过，咱们要换活儿干了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，别摆这么严肃的表情，啊，还是说你一直都这副脸？小天马？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每个月提个十七八次请假申请的人能说是认真吗......唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得庆幸耀骑士冲进感染者聚集区，和一群手持短弓的神秘杀手大打出手的新闻没有出现在报纸头条上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然大部分媒体都还是我们的合作伙伴，但压下这些东西还是要花不少钱的，他们可不会放过这个要钱的好机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会承担这些损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有这个自觉就好，虽然你根本承担不起太多次这样的失误。董事会给你的工资没那么高吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，好啦，扮黑脸可不是我的强项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还是好同事，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您这么认为的话，那我们就是，罗伊阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，这么喊就生疏了不是？“白金”欣特莱雅......你看，被喊到名字的时候总会觉得很难受吧？还是用昵称吧，小天马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔的天马有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我是在喊你就成......对了，还有件事，不过这是件小事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"从您嘴里说出来，我都不敢当小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怕是对我有些误解，我愿意说给你听的基本都是小事，大事嘛......啊哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。听说你放了瑟奇亚克的小儿子一命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......恰尔内在那个时候已经被解除了职务，我没必要听他的话，去对一个孩子动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，挺直白，没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然恰尔内也是个可怜人，不过麻烦的不是这件事......简单来说，瑟奇亚克失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塑料骑士并不是什么名门望族，只是在骑士竞技中后来居上的典型......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然本来就没打算下死手，但他也是呼啸守卫的财产，被其他人捷足先登也不是什么好事。我们会收到联合会的投诉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"查到是谁干的了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白，不过是几个感染者骑士，怎么能做到这个地步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，小白金，这正是我们要去弄清楚的事情啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过有一点你可别弄错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"还请明示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我们要面对的，是全卡瓦莱利亚基的感染者，不是“区区几个”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅什科工业已经交付了八个新地块，零号地块的作用很快就要发挥起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过吧？我们会忙起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯嗯，明白就好。咳咳。嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......今天真热啊，你感觉不到吗，不用戴头盔真是幸福啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你都看不出我有什么变化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"您染了头发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括尾巴，全套染色喔，怎么样？适合不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"很合适您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一副不耐烦的表情是要怎样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"这是您的私人问题，我想我不需要过问吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你看嘛，你是“白金大位”，一头白发，白衣白袍。莫妮克又是维多利亚人，天生蓝发，穿上一身青金制服，合适得不得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我黑乎乎的，站在莫妮克旁边像个扫厕所的，好像就我不合群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以出于企业形象考虑，我也去染了个色，啊哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"您高兴就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"narration","text":"1:22 P.M.  天气/晴\n大骑士领卡瓦莱利亚基，城区夹缝，感染者聚集区"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......我回来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......花了很久，索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，遇到了一些事情嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听灰毫说了，先前那场“工业事故”，是耀骑士帮了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，这就是名人效应吗，怎么感觉大家都知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是个怎么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这可真稀奇，原来你也会有好奇别人的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的老家，有一座竞技场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个小竞技场里没什么比赛，只是跟风建造的狭小竞技场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那时......开始憧憬骑士，也在那里听着耀骑士的传说长大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好几年前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？你可没跟我们说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你有告诉过我你小时候是个什么样的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！有道理，那以后我们多聊聊过去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么远的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了那么远的路来到大骑士领，可不是为了再去追忆故乡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不必这么严肃吧，就聊聊天嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聊天......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们可以正大光明地坐在甜品店里的那天，我们可以聊一个下午，叫上灰毫和野鬃，一下午。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......她是个怎么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这个嘛，其实，嗯，我们就打了个照面。我连她有没有看清我的脸都不知道，情况突然嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"别、别这么失望呀，我也不能在无胄盟杀手的面前和我们的冠军选手聊天吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，她还是救了我这么一个感染者，哪怕明知道有人在盯着她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许她真的是那个耀骑士。那些......那些感染者们想象出来的耀骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么话——别说这个了，你救下的那位可怜人怎么样了？那个老父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你问我怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......箭在弦上，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要让那帮低贱的凶手付出代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅女士，还有罗德岛的博士，请进吧，这里就是各位的住房。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位的套房在楼上，参与医疗项目的各位医生则在十二层休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......不用这么拘谨，阿米娅女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到罗德岛的领导人，会是这么一位年轻可爱的卡特斯姑娘，真是年轻有为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没有的事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛确实离不开阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米娅一直很努力。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博、博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，害羞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可爱的孩子，如果我有个孙女，也差不多你这般大吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，脸都红了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，还是很抱歉，考虑到各位的特殊身份，我们没法安排统一的会面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......没关系的，我们能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......“砾”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是四阶征战骑士，叫她“砾”吧，也是一位年轻有为的青年骑士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她会负责二位在卡瓦莱利亚基的人身安全，有什么事情，交给她就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可不能让各国的来宾贵族，以及贵司这样优秀的合作伙伴在特锦赛期间蒙受损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们理解，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢二位，那我也不打搅诸位休息了，就把时间留给年轻人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砾，保护好罗德岛的各位职员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......我就在门外，有什么事的话，请随时吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，唔，砾小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅阿米娅，她是不是在盯着你？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"请问您还有什么事吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一件事......我能靠近您一些吗？对，就像这样，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎么脸红了？这只是初见的问候，可没什么其他的意思哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，卡西米尔骑士砾，就请您多有包涵啦，嘻嘻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"刚......刚才......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“这只是初见的问候”，是这么说的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"卡西米尔人打招呼的方式真是奇特......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，听说亲吻礼确实是一些贵族之间打招呼的方式......既、既然是骑士的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"应该确实是这个意思吧......？应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很紧张吗？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......确实有一点紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过比起一开始见到的几位监正会骑士，那位老奶奶已经慈祥很多啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？博士累了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也是啦，抵达卡西米尔之后，好像就一直在应付那些合同啊，礼节之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在喘口气吧，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"终于结束了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......博士也松了一口气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果负责联合医疗任务的，都是刚才那位老奶奶那样通情达理的骑士就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这也是难得的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"听说卡西米尔的大骑士领，每隔数年会从发展迅速的移动城邦中选出三座，与大骑士领核心城合并。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这样想来，真是让人惊叹的壮举。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"外面的广告灯可真亮啊。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我曾以为这里会是一座更严肃庄重的城市。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我也有点意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然......一直有听临光小姐谈论她的家乡，不过没想到卡西米尔的中心居然会是这样的风貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"想出去逛逛吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"有什么想买的？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！？没、没有，我只是很少造访这么繁华的城市而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，感染者像这样住在繁华都市的高层酒店里，其实是非常罕见的一件事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是罗德岛成功拿下了医疗业务合同，恐怕我们不会受到这样的礼遇吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道临光小姐......她现在怎么样了呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"突然提出要离开罗德岛的时候，吓了人一跳。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我们应该相信临光小姐，这是她的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望她能够平安无事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可既然闪灵小姐和夜莺小姐也陪在她身边，应该......没什么问题吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"她可是耀骑士，这里才是她的地盘。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！我们应该信任临光小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她可是耀骑士——是卡西米尔骑士的顶峰之一，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！博士，快看外面的大屏幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那是临光小姐吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"根据你上次说的意见，调整了武器重心，做了伸缩的功能，这样的话应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，玛莉娅......抱歉，你刚才说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐发呆的样子可不多见，怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然在罗德岛的时候，我也有听说过一些传闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里......真的变了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......家具都卖掉不少啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然叔叔是那副态度，但如果不是他的话，可能我们去年就已经从这座宅子里搬出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天，骑士协会的人又来催促了......不管是我还是姐姐，我们要么代表某支骑士团，要么代表家族出战，否则......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，我会解决的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，这才是姐姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，这是姐姐的武器，我和科瓦尔师傅已经调整过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这几天应该没有姐姐的比赛吧？为什么磨损得这么严重......？就好像被爆破物袭击过一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来都没有想过，大骑士领，居然会有这么多的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"玛嘉烈无声地望向远方，高楼广厦。\n但她无法遗忘被垃圾倒满的那些阴暗地下，闪烁的火光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在感染者也能成为骑士了，血骑士确实是个了不起的人，只看结果的话，他让很多感染者免遭厄运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但“骑士”不该是这样的，感染者，也不该因为身患疾病，就这么卑微地被当做玩物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜也许......只是想帮助那些感染者而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"工厂在运作，矿洞也没有停止过开采，城市在发展，底层的感染者就会愈来愈多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"本来，他们都会被流放到荒野上......但红松骑士团出钱买下了他们。买下了那些无家可归的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"科瓦尔师傅是这么和我说的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这样并不能改变什么，他们在这座城市并没有容身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......类似的事，以前也会有一些感染者骑士偷偷去做，但商业联合会不会允许那么多感染者贫民躲藏在城市之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......监正会就会允许吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那些执政贵族更不乐意看着感染者光明正大地游走在他们的城市中，他们也会采取某些手段的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"最近电视里总是出现一些感染者的新闻，还有矿石病相关的研究会议......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在散播恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"媒体想用这种形式，让普通民众对感染者感到恐惧，哪怕这会让感染者骑士法案起到的维稳作用再度失效——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——而且，可怕之处在于，这套媒体说辞......几乎必定得逞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别总是愁眉苦脸的，钱可不会掉进阴郁的口袋里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士可是在做一件大好事，帮助那些躲藏在城市暗处的感染者，多么高尚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"她能为他们提供生路吗？她能治疗矿石病吗？她能长久地帮助感染者对抗整个社会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不准呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"少说风凉话，托兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你没别的事情可做了吗？那就离开大骑士领，回你的匪窝去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在姐妹俩安然无恙，就要赶我走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"报酬已经给过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那点钱只是走个过场......你知道我们之间到底在用什么做筹码，玛恩纳老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁允许你踏入我的房间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，这块地毯还不错......莱塔尼亚的纺织品，明天就要拖走卖掉了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两个萨卡兹骑士的来历已经有些眉目了，作为同族，我可真怜悯这些“骑士”们的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我得提醒你，这已经不在我们谈好的生意范畴之内了......我的工作早就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难得来一趟卡瓦莱利亚基，我也有自己的目的。本来是想试试看能不能说服你——不过看来没戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别露出这种表情，我们的关系不比从前啦，玛恩纳阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是一介籍籍无名的赏金猎人，对于这座大骑士领而言，我什么都不是，而你呢——哦，哈，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像也什么都不是了，那我们可真是同病相怜啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["玛嘉烈"]},{"speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
